---
import PlatformLayout from '@/layouts/PlatformLayout.astro';
---

<PlatformLayout title="Terms | InstaStore" description="Basic terms for use of InstaStore commerce software.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
    <p class="font-label-sm text-label-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary">Terms</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display-md text-display-md text-primary">Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-on-surface-variant">These concise service terms describe the intended use of the InstaStore MVP. The copy requires owner and legal review before commercial launch.</p>
    <div class="mt-stack-lg space-y-7 leading-relaxed text-on-surface-variant">
      <section><h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">The service</h2><p class="mt-2">InstaStore provides storefront and order-management software for merchants. Merchants are responsible for the products they display, including product information, descriptions, prices, inventory and sale pricing.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Orders and payment</h2><p class="mt-2">A merchant supplies its own bank-transfer details. Payments are made to the merchant, not to InstaStore. The merchant is responsible for reviewing payment receipts, confirming payments, fulfilling orders and answering customer questions about delivery. Delivery areas, providers, fees and estimates are supplied by the merchant.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Acceptable use</h2><p class="mt-2">Users must not misuse the service, attempt unauthorized access, interfere with storefront or order operations, or use the service for unlawful activity.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary">Availability and privacy</h2><p class="mt-2">Service availability is not guaranteed to be uninterrupted. Information about data use and privacy choices is described separately in the <a class="font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4" href="/privacy">Privacy notice</a>.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</PlatformLayout>
